# Time literals: number and unit checked; canonical range with "to".
The connection "session" times out after "30 s".
The timer "backoff" repeats every "1 s a 60 s".
The timer "fast" repeats every "500 ms to 2 min".
The thread "clock" repeats every "1.5 h".
The thread "cleanup" repeats every "1d".
The connection "slow" times out after "30 seconds".
The connection "no unit" times out after "30".
The timer "inverted" repeats every "60 s to 1 s".
The connection "object" times out after the value "ttl".
